<title>INDIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>INDIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970420)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 20 Apr - The leader of India's United Front coalition,    *</p>
<p> *	    Inder Kumar Gujral, said that President Shankar  *</p>
<p> *	    Dayal Sharma had named him prime minister.	 *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 25 Jul 92)...........Shankar Dayal SHARMA</p>
<p> Vice President........Kocheril Raman NARAYANAN</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Prime Minister-designate...........I.K. GUJRAL</p>
<p>	  (To be sworn in 21 Apr 97)	    (**See Note Above)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> OUTGOING UNITED FRONT (UF) COALITION GOVERNMENT</p>
<p> (Formed 1 June 96):</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Sworn in 1 June 96).........H.D. DEVE GOWDA**</p>
<p>	    (** Tendered resignation 12 Apr 97 - SEE NOTE ABOVE)</p>
<p>(Also Urban Affairs &amp; Employment, Personnel, Public</p>
<p>Grievances &amp; Pensions, Atomic Energy and all other</p>
<p>ministries and departments not allocated to any other</p>
<p>cabinet minister or minister of state with independent</p>
<p>charge).</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET:</p>
<p>Agriculture (excluding Department of Animal Husbandry &amp;</p>
<p>Dairying)..Chaturanan MISHRA</p>
